1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,500
Two source-linked medication instructions
disagree.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,414
The record shows a clinical conflict, not
a guess.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Status: unresolved, at high severity.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,714
Each side opens the exact saved source
behind it.

5
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,600
The conflicting instruction is equally
addressable.

6
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,600
Neither source wins automatically.

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,200
Staff cannot dismiss a high-risk conflict.

8
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:29,700
Publication to the patient stays blocked.
